    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - this method can handle or propagate exceptions; see class-level\nJavadoc for details.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 此方法可以处理或传播异常；有关详细信息，请参阅类级别的 Javadoc。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Also provides a <a href=\"#getDelegate()\"><code>getDelegate()</code></a> method to return the decorated\nhandler as well as a <a href=\"#getLastHandler()\"><code>getLastHandler()</code></a> method to go through all nested\ndelegates and return the \"last\" handler.",
      "translation": "还提供了<a href=\"#getDelegate()\"><code>getDelegate()</code></a>方法以返回装饰后的处理器，以及<a href=\"#getLastHandler()\"><code>getLastHandler()</code></a>方法来遍历所有嵌套的委托并返回“最后”一个处理器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked after WebSocket negotiation has succeeded and the WebSocket connection is\nopened and ready for use.",
      "translation": "WebSocket 协商成功后且 WebSocket 连接已打开并准备就绪时调用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Invoked when a new WebSocket message arrives.",
      "translation": "当新的 WebSocket 消息到达时触发。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Handle an error from the underlying WebSocket message transport.",
      "translation": "处理底层 WebSocket 消息传输的错误。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the WebSocketHandler handles partial messages. If this flag is set to\n<code>true</code> and the underlying WebSocket server supports partial messages,\nthen a large WebSocket message, or one of an unknown size may be split and\nmaybe received over multiple calls to\n<a href=\"../WebSocketHandler.html#handleMessage(org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketSession,org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketMessage)\"><code>WebSocketHandler.handleMessage(WebSocketSession, WebSocketMessage)</code></a>. The flag\n<a href=\"../WebSocketMessage.html#isLast()\"><code>WebSocketMessage.isLast()</code></a> indicates if\nthe message is partial and whether it is the last part.",
      "translation": "WebSocketHandler 是否处理部分消息。如果此标志设置为<code>true</code>，且底层 WebSocket 服务器支持部分消息，则大型 WebSocket 消息或大小未知的消息可能会被拆分，并通过多次调用<a href=\"../WebSocketHandler.html#handleMessage(org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketSession,org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketMessage)\"><code>WebSocketHandler.handleMessage(WebSocketSession, WebSocketMessage)</code></a>接收。标志<a href=\"../WebSocketMessage.html#isLast()\"><code>WebSocketMessage.isLast()</code></a>指示消息是否为部分消息以及是否为最后一部分。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
